###> Claude Code ###
# Only the shared project configuration is versioned: skills, subagent definitions
# and settings.json. Everything else in .claude/ stays local and private
# (settings.local.json, worktrees/, agent memory and other per-user files).
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
